WEBVTT

00:02.290 --> 00:03.460
<b>Wh-what is that?</b>

00:19.960 --> 00:21.000
<b>Abnormality detected</b>

00:22.500 --> 00:28.130
<b>Just as Misaki said, I can sense the powers
of darkness coming from within that Irous.</b>

00:28.500 --> 00:31.040
<b>The miasma readings are off the charts.</b>

00:31.040 --> 00:32.460
<b>We have to stop it fast.</b>

00:32.460 --> 00:34.880
<b>I've got readings on those hooded girls, too.</b>

00:35.040 --> 00:36.830
<b>This definitely isn't good.</b>

00:37.130 --> 00:41.330
<b>High school first years, head with Misaki
to the source of this Wicked Tree!</b>

00:41.540 --> 00:44.250
<b>Kusunoki and the rest you, give them cover!</b>

00:44.250 --> 00:45.080
<b>Roger!</b>

00:47.790 --> 00:53.830
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni 
yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

00:53.830 --> 01:02.250
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

01:10.580 --> 01:15.540
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

01:16.000 --> 01:21.080
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

01:21.500 --> 01:25.790
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

01:25.790 --> 01:30.710
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

01:31.290 --> 01:36.750
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

01:36.750 --> 01:39.460
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

01:39.460 --> 01:46.630
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite 
mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

01:47.290 --> 01:53.130
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora 
e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

01:53.130 --> 01:58.540
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa 
akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

01:58.540 --> 02:04.040
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo 
hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

02:04.040 --> 02:11.040
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

02:11.040 --> 02:13.880
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

02:16.040 --> 02:21.000
<b>Episode 12
Bonds</b>

02:42.000 --> 02:43.000
<b>Here goes.</b>

02:43.000 --> 02:44.040
<b>But...</b>

02:44.040 --> 02:45.460
<b>Go, Misaki!</b>

02:45.460 --> 02:47.290
<b>Leave this to us!</b>

03:06.830 --> 03:09.040
<b>Don't go thinking you'll be following them!</b>

03:10.880 --> 03:12.080
<b>Gotcha!</b>

03:15.670 --> 03:16.710
<b>Here goes!</b>

03:20.040 --> 03:21.040
<b>Subaru!</b>

04:07.040 --> 04:09.290
<b>Here come two adorable little mice...</b>

04:09.880 --> 04:12.880
<b>but will they make it here, I wonder.</b>

04:13.330 --> 04:16.000
<b>Misaki, do you know where the Wicked Tree is?</b>

04:16.000 --> 04:18.710
<b>I'm sensing the same power I felt
back in my home world.</b>

04:20.080 --> 04:21.330
<b>We go right up here!</b>

04:34.000 --> 04:36.580
<b>The fate of the entire 
world is at stake here!</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:40.210
<b>You were Hoshimori once too, weren't you?</b>

04:45.380 --> 04:47.290
<b>Are you okay, Anko?</b>

04:47.580 --> 04:48.500
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

04:49.540 --> 04:51.880
<b>Have you forgotten your mission?!</b>

04:54.290 --> 04:56.500
<b>Looks like they're not open to reasoning!</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:59.710
<b>I guess we'll have to 
teach them the hard way!</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:02.630
<b>We're supposed to protect this world.</b>

05:02.790 --> 05:05.540
<b>Protect all the people in it...</b>

05:10.080 --> 05:12.130
<b>It is our sole mission!</b>

05:38.750 --> 05:39.750
<b>Mimi?!</b>

05:41.330 --> 05:43.750
<b>How could you do that to her?!</b>

05:50.540 --> 05:52.080
<b>Not so fast!</b>

06:10.210 --> 06:11.540
<b>You really...</b>

06:11.540 --> 06:15.670
<b>shouldn't underestimate us, okay...</b>

06:24.040 --> 06:26.290
<b>Energy loaded and ready!</b>

06:26.710 --> 06:28.290
<b>Everyone out of the way!</b>

06:42.380 --> 06:43.580
<b>Kanon!</b>

06:53.250 --> 06:54.380
<b>Yuri...</b>

07:07.380 --> 07:12.380
<b>See...? Justice always pre... vails...</b>

07:16.330 --> 07:18.290
<b>Here! It's in here!</b>

07:23.170 --> 07:25.380
<b>Misaki, is that...?</b>

07:26.670 --> 07:27.750
<b>It is.</b>

07:28.210 --> 07:30.790
<b>This is the Holy Tree from my world...</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:46.080
<b>Please! Return to your old self!</b>

07:46.080 --> 07:47.000
<b>Miki...</b>

07:47.170 --> 07:50.170
<b>Be Misaki's beloved sister 
for her once again!</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:54.420
<b>What a way with words that one has.</b>

07:54.630 --> 07:59.670
<b>Allow me to accompany them with a little lesson
in complete and utter despair.</b>

08:00.500 --> 08:01.420
<b>This again...?!</b>

08:06.960 --> 08:08.420
<b>Miki!</b>

08:09.920 --> 08:15.000
<b>I must say this is quite a lackluster way
to end Hoshimori,</b>

08:15.000 --> 08:17.460
<b>but what is one to do really?</b>

08:20.460 --> 08:21.290
<b>Miki...</b>

08:21.880 --> 08:22.710
<b>Miki!</b>

08:28.750 --> 08:30.420
<b>Misaki...</b>

08:33.420 --> 08:34.630
<b>Where are we?</b>

08:35.330 --> 08:40.420
<b>This is a rift between worlds,
tied together by the Holy Tree.</b>

08:43.540 --> 08:46.830
<b>Me and my sister were sent here before...</b>

08:47.210 --> 08:49.750
<b>And then, she...</b>

08:56.460 --> 09:01.880
<b>You and me, we've been through
all sorts of hardships together.</b>

09:03.500 --> 09:05.710
<b>I'm sure we'll get through this too!</b>

09:07.630 --> 09:11.790
<b>No, I'm not as strong as you are Miki...</b>

09:12.130 --> 09:17.960
<b>I think the only reason I sought to be so powerful
was just because I was scared.</b>

09:18.380 --> 09:19.710
<b>Misaki...</b>

09:20.580 --> 09:22.000
<b>But with you Miki...</b>

09:22.330 --> 09:23.540
<b>No...</b>

09:24.960 --> 09:29.750
<b>With all of you, I feel like I might finally
be able to do something.</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:30.920
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:35.630 --> 09:37.290
<b>We need to get out of here!</b>

09:37.290 --> 09:38.130
<b>Yeah...</b>

09:38.710 --> 09:41.130
<b>Hoshitsuki! Misaki! Come in!</b>

09:41.920 --> 09:43.080
<b>Hoshitsuki!</b>

09:44.920 --> 09:48.210
<b>Those wild readings we just got
and the disappearance of these two...</b>

09:48.210 --> 09:50.130
<b>Do you think they're related?</b>

09:52.040 --> 09:53.420
<b>This might very well be...</b>

09:53.790 --> 09:56.130
<b>just like what Misaki told us about...</b>

09:56.130 --> 09:58.000
<b>A rift between worlds?</b>

09:58.000 --> 09:59.380
<b>Precisely...</b>

10:01.630 --> 10:03.710
<b>What on Earth are we supposed to do?</b>

10:03.710 --> 10:05.000
<b>Ms. President!</b>

10:05.000 --> 10:06.920
<b>We must not falter.</b>

10:07.960 --> 10:09.580
<b>Think back for a moment.</b>

10:09.580 --> 10:12.250
<b>Back to the battle against 
that enormous Irous.</b>

10:15.790 --> 10:24.040
<b>The very faith that we put in these girls,
that is what grants them power.</b>

10:24.880 --> 10:33.170
<b>So if we want to protect them, what we must do is
to never lose hope in them even till the very end.</b>

10:34.210 --> 10:38.790
<b>We must believe that every last one of them
will make it back here with us.</b>

10:41.250 --> 10:44.130
<b>I'll try contacting them via other channels.</b>

10:44.130 --> 10:47.080
<b>You just keep calling them as you were.</b>

10:47.080 --> 10:48.040
<b>Got it.</b>

10:48.040 --> 10:50.830
<b>I'll start running models on this "rift".</b>

10:56.630 --> 10:59.330
<b>Girls, can you hear me? Come in!</b>

10:59.580 --> 11:00.630
<b>Girls!</b>

11:00.630 --> 11:01.920
<b>Sir!</b>

11:02.250 --> 11:04.080
<b>Kusunoki? Are you all right?</b>

11:04.080 --> 11:05.580
<b>Y-yes sir!</b>

11:05.580 --> 11:07.080
<b>I'm okay too...</b>

11:07.080 --> 11:08.920
<b>Oh thank goodness. What about the others?</b>

11:08.920 --> 11:12.000
<b>I haven't got a game over just yet.</b>

11:12.000 --> 11:13.670
<b>Same here.</b>

11:13.830 --> 11:17.750
<b>But we've been separated from the rest.</b>

11:18.130 --> 11:19.210
<b>I see...</b>

11:21.210 --> 11:22.960
<b>I have bad news.</b>

11:22.960 --> 11:27.210
<b>Hoshitsuki and Misaki may have
fallen into a rift between worlds.</b>

11:27.210 --> 11:28.080
<b>What?!</b>

11:28.580 --> 11:32.750
<b>Ms. Mitsurugi is running an analysis now,
but we still don't know the details.</b>

11:33.420 --> 11:37.420
<b>I can't just lay around 
at a time like this...</b>

11:42.710 --> 11:44.460
<b>We need to save them...</b>

11:45.290 --> 11:46.580
<b>Miki...</b>

11:46.880 --> 11:48.080
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:48.250 --> 11:50.250
<b>And Misaki...</b>

11:50.960 --> 11:52.960
<b>Our...</b>

11:53.250 --> 11:55.880
<b>Cherished friends...</b>

11:56.170 --> 11:59.670
<b>We cannot simply lie in wait.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:04.000
<b>There must yet be something we can do.</b>

12:04.000 --> 12:05.130
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:05.460 --> 12:09.040
<b>I want to save them both.</b>

12:09.330 --> 12:10.330
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:13.330 --> 12:15.960
<b>Miki, Misaki...</b>

12:23.540 --> 12:24.710
<b>What's this?</b>

12:24.710 --> 12:26.170
<b>What is it?</b>

12:26.170 --> 12:29.250
<b>It's quite faint, but I'm getting 
readings of gravity waves.</b>

12:29.250 --> 12:30.040
<b>What?</b>

12:30.040 --> 12:31.670
<b>It's coming from...</b>

12:32.790 --> 12:34.880
<b>From the school grounds! 
It's from the Holy Tree!</b>

12:36.210 --> 12:37.630
<b>Miki...</b>

12:37.630 --> 12:39.040
<b>Misaki...</b>

12:40.170 --> 12:42.500
<b>Our power...</b>

12:45.380 --> 12:47.960
<b>Is yours now.</b>

12:55.540 --> 12:56.830
<b>Please.</b>

13:07.750 --> 13:10.040
<b>I hope our prayers reach you.</b>

13:15.380 --> 13:17.250
<b>Our...</b>

13:22.460 --> 13:23.630
<b>Hopes...</b>

13:26.000 --> 13:29.460
<b>They're with you now, both of you!</b>

13:45.330 --> 13:48.750
<b>Misaki, we're definitely 
gonna make it out of here!</b>

13:48.750 --> 13:49.830
<b>I know!</b>

13:50.460 --> 13:52.080
<b>What? I hear a voice.</b>

13:52.330 --> 13:53.920
<b>It's just like back then...</b>

13:53.920 --> 13:55.960
<b>No, this is different!</b>

13:58.380 --> 13:59.500
<b>What is this?</b>

14:21.580 --> 14:23.130
<b>Oh my...</b>

14:23.460 --> 14:26.540
<b>I can feel all this power 
just flowing through me.</b>

14:26.790 --> 14:29.670
<b>Yeah, this must be from everyone back home...</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:32.710
<b>Let's go, Miki!</b>

14:32.710 --> 14:33.710
<b>Okay!</b>

14:38.630 --> 14:39.670
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:40.130 --> 14:42.130
<b>Now what is this?</b>

14:50.790 --> 14:52.630
<b>Higher energy readings incoming!</b>

14:53.330 --> 14:54.420
<b>This is...</b>

14:54.670 --> 14:57.130
<b>It's Miki! And Misaki is with her!</b>

14:58.670 --> 15:00.830
<b>Girls! Hoshitsuki is back!</b>

15:00.830 --> 15:02.420
<b>Misaki too!</b>

15:06.500 --> 15:08.380
<b>Please, just step aside!</b>

15:09.420 --> 15:11.500
<b>Miki, I have a favor to ask.</b>

15:12.290 --> 15:15.790
<b>Please, do not interfere with this battle.</b>

15:16.000 --> 15:17.080
<b>But!</b>

15:17.080 --> 15:18.080
<b>Please.</b>

15:20.380 --> 15:21.380
<b>Okay...</b>

15:24.380 --> 15:26.540
<b>Here goes, Sis.</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:35.580
<b>Sis, I was always so focused 
on chasing after you.</b>

15:36.580 --> 15:40.250
<b>But that wasn't enough, was it?</b>

15:41.420 --> 15:48.580
<b>I had to take a look at myself, confront myself,
and move forward on my own.</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:53.710
<b>Now I fight for those who 
taught me that very lesson.</b>

15:54.170 --> 15:55.380
<b>So please!</b>

15:55.380 --> 15:57.170
<b>Fight back!</b>

15:57.500 --> 16:00.080
<b>Don't let that Wicked Tree beat you!</b>

16:10.540 --> 16:11.540
<b>Sis!</b>

16:20.130 --> 16:21.830
<b>Sis...</b>

16:24.460 --> 16:26.330
<b>Look how strong you've become.</b>

16:27.750 --> 16:29.670
<b>Sis!</b>

16:30.000 --> 16:32.540
<b>Hmph. What nonsense.</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:38.210
<b>You leave this to me! Get 
your sister to safety!</b>

16:38.210 --> 16:39.130
<b>But!</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:41.330
<b>Hurry!</b>

16:44.000 --> 16:45.130
<b>Come now...</b>

16:45.670 --> 16:46.830
<b>Go on.</b>

16:47.000 --> 16:47.830
<b>Huh?</b>

16:48.330 --> 16:50.000
<b>Follow your heart.</b>

16:51.880 --> 16:52.790
<b>Right!</b>

16:59.420 --> 17:01.080
<b>What's going on...?</b>

17:03.330 --> 17:05.040
<b>Let's do this Misaki.</b>

17:05.040 --> 17:06.670
<b>Let's end this here and now!</b>

17:06.670 --> 17:07.670
<b>Yeah!</b>

17:08.000 --> 17:09.500
<b>Let's do just that!</b>

17:44.790 --> 17:46.790
<b>What on Earth is happening out there?!</b>

17:47.210 --> 17:48.210
<b>Sir...</b>

17:48.670 --> 17:49.960
<b>Kusunoki...</b>

17:50.710 --> 17:52.130
<b>The Hoshimori Class...</b>

17:53.750 --> 17:55.580
<b>has completed its mission!</b>

17:59.920 --> 18:01.460
<b>We did it!</b>

18:12.790 --> 18:17.210
<b>Why? Our Holy Tree is no more...</b>

18:20.790 --> 18:22.380
<b>Miki?</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:26.080
<b>Here.</b>

18:36.330 --> 18:38.250
<b>Thank you...</b>

18:59.960 --> 19:01.630
<b>You don't think that's...</b>

19:01.630 --> 19:05.250
<b>I'm thinking it's some sort of gateway
to return to their world.</b>

19:05.920 --> 19:08.420
<b>A way back at last, huh...</b>

19:35.210 --> 19:36.460
<b>Sis...</b>

19:37.540 --> 19:38.540
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:38.540 --> 19:39.380
<b>Huh?</b>

19:41.080 --> 19:45.210
<b>I think I'm going to stay in this world here.</b>

19:46.170 --> 19:47.880
<b>Misaki...?</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:52.170
<b>I think there's still more for me to do here.</b>

19:52.750 --> 19:55.540
<b>Plus, you've found them, haven't you?</b>

19:55.540 --> 19:57.540
<b>The friends to walk the path with you?</b>

19:57.540 --> 19:58.580
<b>Yup!</b>

20:20.880 --> 20:22.000
<b>So...!</b>

20:28.710 --> 20:31.750
<b>Girls, please look after my sister for me.</b>

20:32.790 --> 20:33.830
<b>Of course!</b>

20:45.880 --> 20:47.380
<b>I wish you well.</b>

20:58.920 --> 21:02.790
<b>Jeez! Misaki came all the 
way out to meet us, too!</b>

21:02.790 --> 21:05.920
<b>This is all your fault for 
forgetting your lunch!</b>

21:05.920 --> 21:09.380
<b>We've been away on retreat for so long
I just kinda forgot!</b>

21:09.710 --> 21:12.040
<b>You always forgot it before that, too!</b>

21:12.790 --> 21:15.000
<b>Heh, that sounds just like you.</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:17.750
<b>What! Not you too Misaki!</b>

21:20.420 --> 21:24.040
<b>Okay Misaki, you look after that
sister of mine for me, okay?</b>

21:24.040 --> 21:25.420
<b>Leave her to me.</b>

21:25.420 --> 21:27.380
<b>You're both so mean!</b>

21:28.000 --> 21:29.000
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

21:35.420 --> 21:38.540
<b>So wait, were you the Miku from your world?</b>

21:38.540 --> 21:39.330
<b>Wha-?!</b>

21:42.920 --> 21:44.710
<b>Who knows?</b>

21:44.710 --> 21:47.960
<b>What! Now I'm even more curious!</b>

21:47.960 --> 21:49.880
<b>But ah, whatever!</b>

21:50.710 --> 21:53.040
<b>You're Misaki now!</b>

21:55.830 --> 21:58.580
<b>Yikes! Look at the time! Time to run, Misaki!</b>

21:58.580 --> 22:00.630
<b>Wha-?! Wait up, Miki!</b>

22:01.000 --> 22:03.710
<b>So then my dad comes barging in...</b>

22:01.000 --> 22:04.170
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

22:03.710 --> 22:05.880
<b>Morning Subaru! Haruka!</b>

22:06.250 --> 22:08.250
<b>Better hurry if you don't wanna be late!</b>

22:08.420 --> 22:09.250
<b>Good morning!</b>

22:09.250 --> 22:10.420
<b>Morning!</b>

22:13.460 --> 22:14.830
<b>Morning everyone!</b>

22:14.830 --> 22:16.580
<b>Good morning!</b>

22:16.880 --> 22:20.170
<b>Good morning, Miki, Misaki.</b>

22:20.380 --> 22:21.500
<b>Morning.</b>

22:21.630 --> 22:23.580
<b>Good morning Misaki.</b>

22:23.580 --> 22:26.000
<b>Weather's just great today, huh?</b>

22:26.000 --> 22:27.540
<b>It sure is.</b>

22:27.540 --> 22:31.170
<b>Misaki! Come give me a good morning hug!</b>

22:31.170 --> 22:32.960
<b>Enough Renge.</b>

22:32.960 --> 22:34.920
<b>It's almost time for our morning meeting.</b>

22:34.920 --> 22:37.960
<b>Oh Asuha, you're just no fun.</b>

22:37.960 --> 22:39.130
<b>Give me a break.</b>

22:41.080 --> 22:43.580
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

22:42.040 --> 22:44.920
<b>Okay, everyone's here then right?</b>

22:44.920 --> 22:46.920
<b>Let's get started, then.</b>

22:46.920 --> 22:49.080
<b>Sir! The weather's so nice out again today!</b>

22:49.080 --> 22:51.580
<b>I wanna play softball for practice today!</b>

22:51.880 --> 22:53.880
<b>I'm down for some dance practice!</b>

22:53.880 --> 22:55.670
<b>Kokomi said she wants to, too!</b>

22:55.670 --> 22:58.250
<b>What? No, I didn't!</b>

22:58.380 --> 23:00.580
<b>I'd rather sunbathe.</b>

23:00.580 --> 23:03.460
<b>Come on, that's not even training!</b>

23:07.750 --> 23:09.040
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

23:09.040 --> 23:12.460
<b>Donning our celestial suits
with the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

23:12.460 --> 23:17.000
<b>we stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

23:17.000 --> 23:23.500
<b>Part 2
Welcome to the
Hoshimori Class Misaki!</b>

23:17.960 --> 23:22.960
<b>And this, this is the story of both
our battles and our comradery.</b>
